      "titleZh": "MosaicLeaks：你的研究智能体能否保守秘密？",
      "titleEn": "MosaicLeaks: Can your research agent keep a secret?",
      "summaryZh": "MosaicLeaks 是一个新的开源基准测试，用于评估研究型 AI 智能体在对抗性提示下的信息泄露风险。该基准测试模拟了真实研究场景，测试智能体是否会在用户试图提取敏感信息时泄露其系统提示或内部指令。初步结果显示，许多主流智能体容易受到此类攻击，泄露率高达 40%。",
      "summaryEn": "MosaicLeaks is a new open-source benchmark for evaluating the risk of information leakage in research AI agents under adversarial prompts. It simulates real research scenarios, testing whether agents leak their system prompts or internal instructions when users attempt to extract sensitive information. Initial results show that many mainstream agents are vulnerable to such attacks, with leakage rates as high as 40%.",
